==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gem|fr}} {{term|tukkar}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/tu.ʃe/|lang=fr}}, {{X-SAMPA|/tu.Se/}}
* {{audio|Fr-toucher.ogg|Audio (France, Paris)}}
* {{rhymes|e|lang=fr}}
* {{exthomophones|touchai|touché|touchée|touchées|touchers|touchés|touchez|lang=fr}}

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|m}}

# The act of [[touching]] {{i|cfr. infra}}.
# A way of touching.
# The [[sensorial function]] [[touch]].

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# {{transitive|lang=fr}} To [[touch]] (physically).
#: ''Ne me '''touche''' pas !''
#:: ''Don't touch me!''
# {{transitive|lang=fr}} To [[move]] (emotionally)
# To [[affect]]
#: ''La maladie touche actuellement 2 millions de personnes.''
#:: ''The disease currently affects 2 million people.''
# {{intransitive|followed by "[[à#French|à]]"|lang=fr}} To [[try]], to [[try out]].
#: ''Je n'ai jamais '''touché''' au tabac''
#:: ''I've never tried tobacco''

====Conjugation====
{{fr-conj-er|touch|avoir}}

